# Final launch capability audit

**Hold cut-over.** Booking delivery still needs verification, five tours block date selection, and the release still uses Webflow-hosted resources.

Audited 21 November 2026 NZDT. [Hosted release](https://navi.sygnal.cloud/) · [Current production](https://www.tournewzealand.com/)

## Blockers

### Booking and payments

- [ ] 1. Fix the Studio-to-n8n booking handoff.
- [ ] 2. Confirm a test booking and enquiry reach email and Google Sheets.
- [ ] 3. Send the form-load timestamp with each tour booking.
- [ ] 4. Show an error when a booking fails and prevent duplicate submits.
- [ ] 5. Fix the five broken calendars or enable manual date entry.
- [ ] 6. Move card entry on `/booking` to hosted checkout.
- [ ] 7. Fix the payment buttons on `/payment/`.
- [ ] 8. Verify both payment providers in test mode.
- [ ] 9. Confirm contact and agent forms reach the right recipients.

### Webflow dependencies

- [x] 10. Host the two Webflow CDN images locally.
- [x] 11. Hidden search box. No launch action needed.
- [ ] 12. Fix or remove the legacy form script with missing imports.
- [ ] 13. Retest navigation and forms with Webflow hosts blocked.

## Before launch

